## B.4 Moon information and alerts

Display the current or selected-date moon phase using a reliable calculation or data source.

Where a suitable source is available, show local moonrise and moonset times.

Build an alert interface that lets the user select an event or astronomical occurrence and view its relevant time.

For example, display a moonrise notification only when the underlying location and data support the stated time.

